        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Ivar Offset Door Handle - 36 Inch - Satin Stainless Steel</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back to back mounting, the Ivar 36 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Door Offset Handle is great for commercial or residential settings. This Offset Satin Stainless Round Pull has 36 inch mounting centers and is 37-1/4 inches in overall length. It has an easy to care for satin stainless steel finish. The Ivar Offset Door Handle is available to fit doors up to 3 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/ivar-12-inch-satin-stainless-steel-door-offset-handle\"><b>12 Ivar Inch Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/ivar-24-inch-satin-stainless-steel-door-offset-handle\"><b>24 Ivar Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Round Offset Doorware Designs RDOPULL36-630:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 37-1/4\" (946mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 36\" (914mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with removable round rosettes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RDOPULL36-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RDOPULL36 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ivar 36 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Door Offset Handle",
                "description": "Available in thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back to back mounting, the Ivar 36 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Door Offset Handle is great for commercial or residential settings. This Offset Satin Stainless Round Pull has 36 inch mounting centers and is 37-1/4 inches in overall length. It has an easy to care for satin stainless steel finish. The Ivar Offset Door Handle is available to fit doors up to 3 inches thick.",
